{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:94fb9ab95fd9edaf","name":"Martial Arts Forms Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-94fb9ab95fd9edaf","title":"Martial Arts Forms Talent Tree","revision":20898,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:44:53Z","sha256":"45cdd40f0561af114d212f937370a62b33ec0a3ac5e69efd7a54e93eb594b569","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20898","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Martial%20Arts%20Forms%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-94fb9ab95fd9edaf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have advanced training in one or more martial art forms, turning your body into a lethal weapon. Although any character can practice these forms, you have the dedication and perseverance to go beyond what most beings are capable of.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Echani Expertise"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When making an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"},", you extend your critical threat range by 1 (for example, 19-20 instead of 20). However, anything other than a Natural 20 is not considered an automatic hit; if you roll anything other than a Natural 20 and still miss the target, you do not score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hijkata Expertise"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you damage a creature or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"},", the target takes a penalty to its next attack roll equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["K'tara Expertise"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn, when you damage a creature or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"},", you can make an attack to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarm","referenceId":"reference:0449aa195af99b14"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". Also, you do not take the -5 penalty to your attack roll if the target is wielding a weapon with more than one hand.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["K'thri Expertise"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Any enemy that begins its turn adjacent to you takes damage equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier (minimum 1 point) if you are able to make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," against them. You can use this Talent only while wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," or no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stava Expertise"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you successfully ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," an enemy, he or she must make an opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," check to break free of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"},". If you are initiating a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"},", you can reroll your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check. However, you must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse. You can use this Talent only while wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," or no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Tae-Jitsu Expertise"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn, when you damage a creature or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"},", compare your attack roll to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},". If your attack roll equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", the target is moved -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", regardless of the damage result of your attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Wrruushi Expertise"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn, when you damage a creature or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"},", you can make an attack against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},". If that attack is successful, the target can only take a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," on their next turn. You can use this Talent only while wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," or no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
